00:24:41.550 --> 00:24:43.749
Your physician will be by to round.

00:24:43.750 --> 00:24:45.489
Between the hours of 11 to 12,

00:24:45.490 --> 00:24:46.889
you're gonna get a CAT scan, the

00:24:46.890 --> 00:24:47.969
result will be back in the

00:24:47.970 --> 00:24:49.569
afternoon, and your physician will

00:24:49.570 --> 00:24:51.629
be be back to discuss the results.

00:24:51.630 --> 00:24:53.389
First is sitting in the bed and

00:24:53.390 --> 00:24:54.589
looking at this clock that I'm

00:24:54.590 --> 00:24:55.889
looking at right now, it's like the

00:24:55.890 --> 00:24:58.029
24 o'clock second by second,

00:24:58.030 --> 00:24:59.949
