00:25:03.090 --> 00:25:05.109
Now the most exciting piece for this

00:25:05.110 --> 00:25:06.929
is this is underway right

00:25:06.930 --> 00:25:08.749
now. We're about halfway through the

00:25:08.750 --> 00:25:10.659
build. The proof of concept of all

00:25:10.660 --> 00:25:12.279
the pieces that got us to where we

00:25:12.280 --> 00:25:13.919
