We've been doing this for 20 years.

00:35:51.830 --> 00:35:53.649
For eight of those clients, we run

00:35:53.650 --> 00:35:55.649
their entire revenue cycle.

00:35:55.650 --> 00:35:57.369
And for the rest of those client, we

